OL,3,GNEWSAForty fixed penalty notices after
OL,4,Amass car 'meet-up'
OL,5,
OL,6,FForty fixed penalty notices were issued
OL,7,Ffollowing the latest "car meet"
OL,8,Finvolving hundreds of vehicles in
OL,9,FAberdeen.
OL,11,FPolice said officers were called out
OL,12,Ffollowing reports of anti-social
OL,13,Fbehaviour and driving at the Beach
OL,14,FBoulevard area on Saturday.
OL,16,FThe "large-scale car meet" involved
OL,17,Fmore than 400 cars.
OL,19,FAround 90 vehicles were stopped, 40
OL,20,Ffixed penalty notices were issued, five
OL,21,Fanti-social behaviour orders were
OL,22,Fissued, and two vehicles were seized.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
